{"id":"a-time-of-gifts","title":"A Time of Gifts: on foot to Constantinople","who":"Patrick Leigh Fermor","when":"1933–1935","vehicle":"On foot (and the odd lift)","kind":"walk","color":"#9f1239","summary":"At eighteen, Patrick Leigh Fermor walks from the Hook of Holland to Constantinople, sleeping in barns, monasteries and castles across a Europe on the eve of war. His books, written decades later, are among the finest travel writing ever.","sources":[{"label":"Intrepid Times: interview with Nick Hunt, who walked the route again","url":"https://intrepidtimes.com/2016/08/nick-hunt/"},{"label":"Patrick Leigh Fermor Society blog: In Paddy's Footsteps","url":"https://patrickleighfermor.org/category/in-paddys-footsteps/"},{"label":"Wikipedia: A Time of Gifts","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Time_of_Gifts"}],"approximate":"Main places from his three books; the paths between them are approximate.","km":3358,"bbox":[4.1312,41.0064,28.9759,51.9773],"stops":[{"name":"Hook of Holland","place":"Hook of Holland","at":[51.9772,4.1315],"date":"Dec 1933","text":"Landing from London on a rainy December night, with a rucksack and very little money.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Hoek_van_Holland_town_centre.jpg/500px-Hoek_van_Holland_town_centre.jpg","page":"Hook of Holland","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hoek_van_Holland_town_centre.jpg","credit":"Cmglee","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Rotterdam","place":"Rotterdam, Netherlands","at":[51.9244,4.4778],"text":"The first steps east through the Dutch winter.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/A_view_of_Rotterdam%2C_taken_from_the_roof_of_the_Maassilo%2C_Rotterdam%2C_The_Netherlands.jpg/500px-A_view_of_Rotterdam%2C_taken_from_the_roof_of_the_Maassilo%2C_Rotterdam%2C_The_Netherlands.jpg","page":"Rotterdam","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_view_of_Rotterdam%2C_taken_from_the_roof_of_the_Maassilo%2C_Rotterdam%2C_The_Netherlands.jpg","credit":"Rob Oo","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Cologne","place":"Cologne, Germany","at":[50.9384,6.96],"text":"Up the Rhine, with Christmas and the cathedral in Cologne.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/K%C3%B6lner_Dom_-_Westfassade_2022_ohne_Ger%C3%BCst-0968_b.jpg/500px-K%C3%B6lner_Dom_-_Westfassade_2022_ohne_Ger%C3%BCst-0968_b.jpg","page":"Cologne Cathedral","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:K%C3%B6lner_Dom_-_Westfassade_2022_ohne_Ger%C3%BCst-0968_b.jpg","credit":"Raimond Spekking","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Heidelberg","place":"Heidelberg, Germany","at":[49.4094,8.6947],"text":"New Year in the old university town.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/K%C3%B6nigstuhl%2C_Heidelberg%2C_U-17.jpg/500px-K%C3%B6nigstuhl%2C_Heidelberg%2C_U-17.jpg","page":"Heidelberg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:K%C3%B6nigstuhl%2C_Heidelberg%2C_U-17.jpg","credit":"Jörg Braukmann","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Munich","place":"Munich, Germany","at":[48.1371,11.5754],"text":"A Germany already changing under the new regime.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG/500px-Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG","page":"Munich","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG","credit":"Martin Falbisoner","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Melk","place":"Melk, Austria","at":[48.2272,15.337],"text":"Down the Danube valley past its great baroque abbeys.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Stift_Melk%2C_Westansicht.jpg/500px-Stift_Melk%2C_Westansicht.jpg","page":"Melk Abbey","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stift_Melk%2C_Westansicht.jpg","credit":"Thomas Ledl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Vienna","place":"Vienna, Austria","at":[48.2084,16.3725],"text":"Weeks in Vienna, earning a little by sketching portraits.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Schoenbrunn_philharmoniker_2012.jpg/500px-Schoenbrunn_philharmoniker_2012.jpg","page":"Vienna","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Schoenbrunn_philharmoniker_2012.jpg","credit":"Superbass","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Bratislava","place":"Bratislava, Slovakia","at":[48.1435,17.1083],"text":"Into Czechoslovakia, with a detour to Prague.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Bratislava_-_Burg_%28b%29.JPG/500px-Bratislava_-_Burg_%28b%29.JPG","page":"Bratislava Castle","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bratislava_-_Burg_%28b%29.JPG","credit":"C.Stadler/Bwag","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Esztergom","place":"Esztergom, Hungary","at":[47.7857,18.7403],"text":"The end of the first book: Easter on the bridge into Hungary.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Basilica_in_Esztergom%2C_Hungary_01.jpg/500px-Basilica_in_Esztergom%2C_Hungary_01.jpg","page":"Esztergom Basilica","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Basilica_in_Esztergom%2C_Hungary_01.jpg","credit":"Pudelek","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Budapest","place":"Budapest, Hungary","at":[47.4979,19.0402],"text":"Hungary, on horseback across the Great Plain, staying with country families.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/View_from_Gell%C3%A9rt_Hill_to_the_Danube%2C_Hungary_-_Budapest_%2828493220635%29.jpg/500px-View_from_Gell%C3%A9rt_Hill_to_the_Danube%2C_Hungary_-_Budapest_%2828493220635%29.jpg","page":"Budapest","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_from_Gell%C3%A9rt_Hill_to_the_Danube%2C_Hungary_-_Budapest_%2828493220635%29.jpg","credit":"Visions of Domino","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Transylvania","place":"Cluj-Napoca, Romania","at":[46.7694,23.59],"text":"Summe